DORSA

This release contains original DORSA code and task adapters, together with
components adapted from open-source research codebases.

Upstream components and frameworks include:

- timm / pytorch-image-models
- MMRotate
- GeoSeg / UNetFormer
- A2Net
- CLAFA
- LWGANet repository structure and selected integration patterns

Please retain this notice, the top-level LICENSE, and task-specific licenses
under subdirectories such as detection/ and segmentation/ when redistributing
the repository.
